{"seq":2,"slug":"communication-psychology","title":"沟通心理学","stage":"DONE","category":"negotiation-communication","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/negotiation-communication/communication-psychology","rating":{"composite":3.7,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":3,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.16,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.5}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"沟通心理学\">沟通心理学</h1><p>沟通不仅仅是信息的传递，更是人与人之间心理世界的碰撞与连接。沟通心理学（Communication Psychology）研究的是人类在交流过程中的心理机制——我们如何倾听、如何理解他人、如何被认知偏差所影响、如何通过语言和非语言信号传达意图，以及如何在高压情境下保持有效对话。与纯粹的沟通技巧不同，沟通心理学关注的是&quot;为什么&quot;——为什么我们会误解他人，为什么某些话语会触发防御反应，为什么有人能让对话双方都感到被理解和尊重。</p>\n<p>本 Hub 从四个核心维度构建沟通心理学的知识体系。第一部分聚焦倾听与共情——这是一切有效沟通的基础，涵盖主动倾听技术、共情沟通的心理学原理、以及 Marshall Rosenberg 的非暴力沟通（NVC）方法；第二部分探讨认知偏误如何扭曲我们的沟通，包括确认偏误、归因错误和情绪触发机制；第三部分解析语言与非语言沟通的心理学，涉及措辞选择的力量、身体语言的解读规律、以及声音和语调如何塑造存在感；第四部分面对最具挑战性的沟通情境——困难对话，整合 Kerry Patterson 等人的关键对话方法、有效反馈技术、以及沟通中的情绪调节策略。</p>\n<p>掌握沟通心理学不是为了&quot;操控&quot;他人，而是为了更真实地理解自己和他人，在复杂的人际情境中做出更明智、更有温度的沟通选择。这些知识和技能适用于职场协作、亲密关系、冲突调解和日常交往中的每一次重要对话。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"listening-empathy","title":"倾听与共情","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/negotiation-communication/communication-psychology/listening-empathy","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"active-listening","title":"主动倾听技术 Active Listening","url":"/l-doc-books/h/negotiation-communication/communication-psychology/listening-empathy/active-listening"},{"seq":2,"slug":"empathic-communication","title":"共情沟通 Empathic Communication","url":"/l-doc-books/h/negotiation-communication/communication-psychology/listening-empathy/empathic-communication"},{"seq":3,"slug":"nonviolent-communication","title":"非暴力沟通 NVC Nonviolent Communication","url":"/l-doc-books/h/negotiation-communication/communication-psychology/listening-empathy/nonviolent-communication"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"cognitive-biases","title":"认知偏误与沟通","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/negotiation-communication/communication-psychology/cognitive-biases","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"confirmation-bias","title":"确认偏误与沟通 Confirmation Bias in Communication","url":"/l-doc-books/h/negotiation-communication/communication-psychology/cognitive-biases/confirmation-bias"},{"seq":2,"slug":"attribution-errors","title":"归因错误 Attribution Errors","url":"/l-doc-books/h/negotiation-communication/communication-psychology/cognitive-biases/attribution-errors"},{"seq":3,"slug":"emotional-triggers","title":"情绪触发与防御机制 Emotional Triggers and Defense Mechanisms","url":"/l-doc-books/h/negotiation-communication/communication-psychology/cognitive-biases/emotional-triggers"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"verbal-nonverbal","title":"语言与非语言沟通","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/negotiation-communication/communication-psychology/verbal-nonverbal","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"language-power","title":"语言的力量与选择 Language Power and Choice","url":"/l-doc-books/h/negotiation-communication/communication-psychology/verbal-nonverbal/language-power"},{"seq":2,"slug":"body-language","title":"身体语言解读 Body Language","url":"/l-doc-books/h/negotiation-communication/communication-psychology/verbal-nonverbal/body-language"},{"seq":3,"slug":"voice-tone-presence","title":"声音、语调与存在感 Voice, Tone, and Presence","url":"/l-doc-books/h/negotiation-communication/communication-psychology/verbal-nonverbal/voice-tone-presence"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"difficult-conversations","title":"困难对话","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/negotiation-communication/communication-psychology/difficult-conversations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"crucial-conversations","title":"关键对话方法 Crucial Conversations","url":"/l-doc-books/h/negotiation-communication/communication-psychology/difficult-conversations/crucial-conversations"},{"seq":2,"slug":"feedback-giving","title":"有效反馈技术 Effective Feedback","url":"/l-doc-books/h/negotiation-communication/communication-psychology/difficult-conversations/feedback-giving"},{"seq":3,"slug":"emotional-regulation","title":"沟通中的情绪调节 Emotional Regulation in Communication","url":"/l-doc-books/h/negotiation-communication/communication-psychology/difficult-conversations/emotional-regulation"}]}]}